# Play check 1 (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC5; it replaces --play-check 1): the five Marines of marine_group. A box over the units,
# a right click away from them (the camera placed in the frame of each, as a trigger may move it), the game's steps until 140; then play_tail.kps's checks. tools/ci.sh wants exit
# code 0 and "0 failures".
mission scenarios/marine_group
video originals

wait game
wait frames 3
mark start
log start tick creep.tiles units:0 units:1 units:2 units:3 units:4 units:5 units:6 units:7
camera 1140 1115 &
press world 980 1080 &
release world 1090 1150
log box selected
expect selected == 5
wait tick >= 2
camera 1140 1115 &
rclick world 1300 1110
wait tick >= 140
include play_tail.kps
